","_id":19991},{"id":1786135438109,"text":"不用想太多，把动作拆开。","rawContent":"不用想太多，把动作拆开。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786149311654,"roundId":"round_1786149286993_m8lxzf9si","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19992},{"id":1786135438110,"text":"第一步，掀开被子，脚踩进拖鞋里。","rawContent":"第一步，掀开被子，脚踩进拖鞋里。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786149311845,"roundId":"round_1786149286993_m8lxzf9si","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19993},{"id":1786135438111,"text":"第二步，去洗手间用温水洗把脸，顺便看看下面还红不红。","rawContent":"第二步，去洗手间用温水洗把脸，顺便看看下面还红不红。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786149312183,"roundId":"round_1786149286993_m8lxzf9si","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19994},{"id":1786135438112,"text":"慢慢来，迟到了大不了扣全勤，爸爸十倍补给你。","rawContent":"慢慢来，迟到了大不了扣全勤，爸爸十倍补给你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786149312383,"roundId":"round_1786149286993_m8lxzf9si","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19995},{"id":1786135438113,"text":"乖，现在先坐起来。爸爸陪着你出门。","rawContent":"乖，现在先坐起来。爸爸陪着你出门。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786149312647,"roundId":"round_1786149286993_m8lxzf9si","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19996},{"id":1786135438114,"text":"啊","sender":"me","time":"08:45","timestamp":1786149957944,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","